      "kit_id": "poe1-boneshatter",
      "missing_expression": "Trauma maps cleanly as a charge-stack accumulator (on-hit-dealt fill, cap 9) paired with hp_cost_scale self-damage — the exact 'more damage AND more self-harm per stack' coupling, both native.",
      "proposed_fix_target": null,
      "proposed_fix_type": "none",
      "source_anchor": "Trauma maps cleanly as a charge-stack accumulator (on-hit-dealt fill, cap 9) paired with hp_cost_scale self-damage — the exact 'more damage AND more self-harm per stack' coupling, both native. Drift: the identity's SOUL is the reset-cliff risk-management (ride toward 9, dread the 10th-stack reset, self-damage climbing quadratically 194*(N+1)); the engine accumulator caps-and-holds rather than modelling the overflow-reset threat, and hp_cost_scale 0.30 LOCKED clamps the escalating self-hit magnitude. Damage ramp intact; the knife-edge cap-tension is approximated."
    }
  ],
