        "geometry": "Small AoE shockwave radiating from the hit point at each strike. Guide does not specify exact radius value. 'Non-Vaal Strike Skills target 1-2 additional nearby Enemy' modifier on gloves extends hit reach. Primary damage is at-target melee contact; secondary shockwave expands to small surrounding area."
